## 18. Commit and Publication Policy

After each completed and verified milestone:

1. Run relevant tests.
2. Run the full suite when required.
3. Verify protected hashes.
4. Inspect all changes.
5. Commit the milestone.
6. Push normally.
7. Verify the remote commit.
8. Record the result.

Do not push incomplete milestones as completed research.

If publication fails, preserve the local work and investigate safely.

## 19. Model Versioning

Use explicit version identifiers for integrated models.

Suggested progression:

- OMEGA-NANO Research Core
- OMEGA-NANO V1
- OMEGA-NANO V2
- OMEGA-NANO V3
- OMEGA-NANO Experimental AGI Candidate

These labels must reflect actual development status.

Do not call a system an AGI model merely because it has an experimental agent interface.

